.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr elfobj 3 ,
.Xr elf_symbol 3 ,
.Xr elf_reloc 3 ,
.Xr elf 5
.Sh STANDARDS
Section types and flags follow the ELF specification.
See
.Xr elfobj 3
for references.
.Sh HISTORY
Section handling has been a core feature of
.Nm libelfobj
since its initial implementation.
.Sh BUGS
.Bl -bullet
.It
There is no API to iterate sections by index directly.
Applications must either store section handles during creation
or use
.Fn elf_find_section
with known names.
.It
COMDAT group processing is incomplete.
.It
Section-to-segment mapping for executable files is not implemented.
.El
